aiSettings.activateDefaultInterpreter  Boat  BAPSTSerial  Full
aiSettings.activateDefaultInterpreter  Boat  BAPSTIf  Full
aiSettings.activateDefaultInterpreter  Boat  BAPSTPlanEnd  Full
